# rover_r0.in - the R0 gate record of the running example (a fictional learner, Ines,
# and two peer reviewers, Kofi and Mei). Read by F12-29's gatecheck.cpp.
gate R0 author:ines reviewers-needed:2
require proposal_one_page
require component_figure
require plan_without_problems
require cut_list
require hardware_list_with_emulated_path
require starter_lab_green
require r3_safety_items_listed safety
evidence proposal_one_page pass file:docs/proposal.md
evidence component_figure pass file:docs/components.svg
evidence plan_without_problems pass file:labs/MP8/rover_plan.out
evidence cut_list pass file:docs/proposal.md
evidence hardware_list_with_emulated_path pass file:docs/hardware.md
evidence starter_lab_green pass file:labs/MP8/contract_tests.log
evidence r3_safety_items_listed pass file:docs/safety_items.md
test contract_tests_16_of_16 pass
test skeleton_nominal pass
test skeleton_perception_freeze pass
reviewer kofi approve
reviewer mei conditions
condition C1-gpu-access-date owner:ines due:15 on:hardware_list_with_emulated_path
